# Claude Code worktree scaffolding -- never track these, they are separate working copies
.claude/worktrees/

# Local-only security review output (issue #115) -- never commit
security-review-local/

# Point-in-time Azure cleanup exports (issue #215): keep new ones local. Already-tracked files are unaffected.
/output/azure-cleanup/
